      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since you\u0027re introducing CONFIG_CMD_KEYBOARD_KBLOG, all these kblog_put will be redundant if !CONFIG_CMD_KEYBOARD_KBLOG. Do you see the compiler smartly ignore this call (because you have kblog_put(type, byte){})?",
