      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-06-27T22:04:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I define a version of `kblog_put()` with an empty body in the `!CONFIG_CMD_KEYBOARD_KBLOG` case. I was hoping this would cause it to get optimized out, but am indeed still seeing the symbol in the build artifacts. I replaced it with a macro wrapper -let me know what you think.",
